ok COOKIE names the session cookie
ok a new session is empty and unchanged
ok []= stores and marks changed
ok to_cookie_value round-trips through load
ok load alone does not mark changed
ok the cookie value is hex.hex
ok delete removes the key and marks changed
ok reset empties and marks changed
ok a different secret does not open the cookie
ok one payload character changed gives an empty session
ok one hmac character changed gives an empty session
ok a truncated cookie gives an empty session
ok a truncated payload gives an empty session
ok a non-hex cookie gives an empty session
ok a cookie without a dot gives an empty session
ok a nil cookie gives an empty session
ok an empty cookie gives an empty session
ok an empty mac gives an empty session
ok extra dots give an empty session
ok a missing payload with a valid-length mac gives an empty session
ok a forged payload signed with another secret is refused
ok a verified but malformed payload gives an empty session
